OL,3,AGlobal scramble to fix critical
OL,4,Acyber-security flaws as many websites
OL,5,Ataken offline
OL,6,
OL,7,FOrganisations around the world are
OL,8,Fscrambling to fix a critical
OL,9,Fcyber-security flaw that could affect
OL,10,Fmillions of websites
OL,12,FThe researcher who helped to identify
OL,13,Fthe flaw says it is "the most serious"
OL,14,Fissue he has ever found
OL,16,FThe vulnerability is within the PHP
OL,17,Fprogramming language - it collects
OL,18,Finformation you need and presents it in
OL,19,Fa way you can read on the web
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
