OL,3,AGlobal scramble to fix critical
OL,4,Acyber-security flaws as many websites
OL,5,Ataken offline
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe issue may affect around 30 million
OL,8,Fwebsites and could allow attackers to
OL,9,Fsteal personal data, one expert tells
OL,10,Fthe BBC
OL,12,FArtificial intelligence identified the
OL,13,Fproblem, prompting warnings from
OL,14,Fgovernments and cyber-security agencies
OL,15,Fto take sites offline - here's how the
OL,16,Fsaga unfolded
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
